{% doc %}
  Outputs the inline CSS variables for .lv-product-grid (see assets/product-grid.css). Accepts: settings (section.settings). Optional defaults: d_xl, d_1024, d_960, d_768, d_650,...

  @param [settings] - Optional settings passed by the parent file
  @param {number} [d_xl] - Optional d xl passed by the parent file
  @param {number} [d_1024] - Optional d 1024 passed by the parent file
  @param {number} [d_960] - Optional d 960 passed by the parent file
  @param {number} [d_768] - Optional d 768 passed by the parent file
  @param {number} [d_650] - Optional d 650 passed by the parent file
  @param {number} [d_mobile] - Optional d mobile passed by the parent file
{% enddoc %}
{%- comment -%}
  Outputs the inline CSS variables for .lv-product-grid (see assets/product-grid.css).
  Accepts: settings (section.settings). Optional defaults: d_xl, d_1024, d_960, d_768, d_650, d_mobile
{%- endcomment -%}
